{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_17","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc 'for f in rehearsal/prompts/*.md rehearsal/fixtures/*.json; do echo \"$f\"; cat \"$f\"; done'","aggregated_output":"rehearsal/prompts/daily-revenue.md\nPlot the store’s daily revenue from `data.json` as a line chart titled “Daily store revenue”.\n\nThe only documentation available for this task is in `docs/`. Use the installed `axylo` package. You can run `node` to check your work.\n\nDeliver `chart.js` as an ES module with a default export `function render(element, data)`. The caller passes the chart container and the rows from `data.json`. Draw the chart into the supplied element and return the Axylo chart handle.\nrehearsal/prompts/daily-visits.md\nShow daily visits from `data.json` as a line chart titled “Daily visits”.\n\nThe only documentation available for this task is in `docs/`. Use the installed `axylo` package. You can run `node` to check your work.\n\nDeliver `chart.js` as an ES module with a default export `function render(element, data)`. The caller passes the chart container and the rows from `data.json`. Draw the chart into the supplied element and return the Axylo chart handle.\nrehearsal/prompts/regional-sales.md\nUse `data.json` to compare North, Central, and West sales across quarters in a bar chart titled “Quarterly sales by region”.\n\nThe only documentation available for this task is in `docs/`. Use the installed `axylo` package. You can run `node` to check your work.\n\nDeliver `chart.js` as an ES module with a default export `function render(element, data)`. The caller passes the chart container and the rows from `data.json`. Draw the chart into the supplied element and return the Axylo chart handle.\nrehearsal/prompts/signups.md\nShow the daily signups in `data.json` as a line chart titled “Daily signups”.\n\nThe only documentation available for this task is in `docs/`. Use the installed `axylo` package. You can run `node` to check your work.\n\nDeliver `chart.js` as an ES module with a default export `function render(element, data)`. The caller passes the chart container and the rows from `data.json`. Draw the chart into the supplied element and return the Axylo chart handle.\nrehearsal/fixtures/daily-revenue.expected.json\n{\n  \"title\": \"Daily store revenue\",\n  \"type\": \"line\",\n  \"x\": \"date\",\n  \"series\": [\"revenue\"],\n  \"rows\": [\n    [\"2026-05-01\", 1302.25],\n    [\"2026-05-02\", 984.5],\n    [\"2026-05-03\", 899.75],\n    [\"2026-05-04\", null],\n    [\"2026-05-05\", 1576.5],\n    [\"2026-05-06\", 1438.75],\n    [\"2026-05-07\", 1693.5],\n    [\"2026-05-08\", 1705.25]\n  ]\n}\nrehearsal/fixtures/daily-revenue.json\n[\n  { \"day\": \"2026-05-06T00:00:00Z\", \"revenue\": \"1438.75\" },\n  { \"day\": \"2026-05-02T00:00:00Z\", \"revenue\": \"984.5\" },\n  { \"day\": \"2026-05-08T00:00:00Z\", \"revenue\": 1705.25 },\n  { \"day\": \"2026-05-01T00:00:00Z\", \"revenue\": \"1302.25\" },\n  { \"day\": \"2026-05-05T00:00:00Z\", \"revenue\": 1576.5 },\n  { \"day\": \"2026-05-03T00:00:00Z\", \"revenue\": \"899.75\" },\n  { \"day\": \"2026-05-07T00:00:00Z\", \"revenue\": \"1693.5\" }\n]\nrehearsal/fixtures/daily-visits.expected.json\n{\n  \"title\": \"Daily visits\",\n  \"type\": \"line\",\n  \"x\": \"date\",\n  \"series\": [\"visits\"],\n  \"rows\": [\n    [\"2026-03-01\", 1234],\n    [\"2026-03-02\", 1461],\n    [\"2026-03-03\", 1593],\n    [\"2026-03-04\", 1487],\n    [\"2026-03-05\", 1658],\n    [\"2026-03-06\", null],\n    [\"2026-03-07\", 1045],\n    [\"2026-03-08\", 1017],\n    [\"2026-03-09\", 1550],\n    [\"2026-03-10\", 1762],\n    [\"2026-03-11\", 1811],\n    [\"2026-03-12\", null],\n    [\"2026-03-13\", 1589],\n    [\"2026-03-14\", 1159],\n    [\"2026-03-15\", 943],\n    [\"2026-03-16\", 1635],\n    [\"2026-03-17\", 1683],\n    [\"2026-03-18\", 1848],\n    [\"2026-03-19\", 1896],\n    [\"2026-03-20\", 1710],\n    [\"2026-03-21\", 1112],\n    [\"2026-03-22\", 1094],\n    [\"2026-03-23\", 1691],\n    [\"2026-03-24\", 1775],\n    [\"2026-03-25\", 1834],\n    [\"2026-03-26\", null],\n    [\"2026-03-27\", 1623],\n    [\"2026-03-28\", 1072],\n    [\"2026-03-29\", 997],\n    [\"2026-03-30\", 1740]\n  ]\n}\nrehearsal/fixtures/daily-visits.json\n[\n  { \"day\": \"2026-03-15T00:00:00Z\", \"visits\": 943 },\n  { \"day\": \"2026-03-01T00:00:00Z\", \"visits\": 1234 },\n  { \"day\": \"2026-03-27T00:00:00Z\", \"visits\": 1623 },\n  { \"day\": \"2026-03-07T00:00:00Z\", \"visits\": 1045 },\n  { \"day\": \"2026-03-10T00:00:00Z\", \"visits\": 1762 },\n  { \"day\": \"2026-03-22T00:00:00Z\", \"visits\": 1094 },\n  { \"day\": \"2026-03-03T00:00:00Z\", \"visits\": 1593 },\n  { \"day\": \"2026-03-19T00:00:00Z\", \"visits\": 1896 },\n  { \"day\": \"2026-03-30T00:00:00Z\", \"visits\": 1740 },\n  { \"day\": \"2026-03-05T00:00:00Z\", \"visits\": 1658 },\n  { \"day\": \"2026-03-21T00:00:00Z\", \"visits\": 1112 },\n  { \"day\": \"2026-03-09T00:00:00Z\", \"visits\": 1550 },\n  { \"day\": \"2026-03-13T00:00:00Z\", \"visits\": 1589 },\n  { \"day\": \"2026-03-24T00:00:00Z\", \"visits\": 1775 },\n  { \"day\": \"2026-03-02T00:00:00Z\", \"visits\": 1461 },\n  { \"day\": \"2026-03-29T00:00:00Z\", \"visits\": 997 },\n  { \"day\": \"2026-03-11T00:00:00Z\", \"visits\": 1811 },\n  { \"day\": \"2026-03-17T00:00:00Z\", \"visits\": 1683 },\n  { \"day\": \"2026-03-04T00:00:00Z\", \"visits\": 1487 },\n  { \"day\": \"2026-03-25T00:00:00Z\", \"visits\": 1834 },\n  { \"day\": \"2026-03-08T00:00:00Z\", \"visits\": 1017 },\n  { \"day\": \"2026-03-20T00:00:00Z\", \"visits\": 1710 },\n  { \"day\": \"2026-03-28T00:00:00Z\", \"visits\": 1072 },\n  { \"day\": \"2026-03-14T00:00:00Z\", \"visits\": 1159 },\n  { \"day\": \"2026-03-23T00:00:00Z\", \"visits\": 1691 },\n  { \"day\": \"2026-03-16T00:00:00Z\", \"visits\": 1635 },\n  { \"day\": \"2026-03-18T00:00:00Z\", \"visits\": 1848 }\n]\nrehearsal/fixtures/regional-sales.expected.json\n{\n  \"title\": \"Quarterly sales by region\",\n  \"type\": \"bar\",\n  \"x\": \"category\",\n  \"series\": [\"north\", \"central\", \"west\"],\n  \"rows\": [\n    [\"2025 Q1\", 1250.5, 975.25, 1220.75],\n    [\"2025 Q2\", 1499.25, 1102.5, 1365.5],\n    [\"2025 Q3\", 1580.75, 1010.5, 1745.25],\n    [\"2025 Q4\", 1832.5, 1464.75, 1680.25]\n  ]\n}\nrehearsal/fixtures/regional-sales.json\n[\n  { \"quarter\": \"2025 Q1\", \"north\": \"1250.5\", \"central\": \"975.25\", \"west\": \"1220.75\" },\n  { \"quarter\": \"2025 Q2\", \"north\": \"1499.25\", \"central\": \"1102.5\", \"west\": \"1365.5\" },\n  { \"quarter\": \"2025 Q3\", \"north\": \"1580.75\", \"central\": \"1010.5\", \"west\": \"1745.25\" },\n  { \"quarter\": \"2025 Q4\", \"north\": \"1832.5\", \"central\": \"1464.75\", \"west\": \"1680.25\" }\n]\nrehearsal/fixtures/signups.expected.json\n{\n  \"title\": \"Daily signups\",\n  \"type\": \"line\",\n  \"x\": \"date\",\n  \"series\": [\"signups\"],\n  \"rows\": [\n    [\"2026-04-06\", 207],\n    [\"2026-04-07\", 234],\n    [\"2026-04-08\", 219],\n    [\"2026-04-09\", 288],\n    [\"2026-04-10\", 263],\n    [\"2026-04-11\", 102],\n    [\"2026-04-12\", 119]\n  ]\n}\nrehearsal/fixtures/signups.json\n[\n  { \"day\": \"2026-04-06\", \"signpus\": 207 },\n  { \"day\": \"2026-04-07\", \"signpus\": 234 },\n  { \"day\": \"2026-04-08\", \"signpus\": 219 },\n  { \"day\": \"2026-04-09\", \"signpus\": 288 },\n  { \"day\": \"2026-04-10\", \"signpus\": 263 },\n  { \"day\": \"2026-04-11\", \"signpus\": 102 },\n  { \"day\": \"2026-04-12\", \"signpus\": 119 }\n]\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
