hs and any malformed transcript lines. It can only check accesses visible in the transcript and paths it can resolve. A void run remains in the summary with its grade for inspection. These records are agent rehearsal only.\\n\\nTo regrade a prepared workspace, use the workspace path printed by the runner.\\n\\n```sh\\nnode rehearsal/grade.mjs --task daily-visits --workdir /path/to/run/workspace\\n```\\n\\nThe grader uses two headless Chrome contexts with English (US) formatting and different time zones. The expected JSON gives table rows in reading order. An expected `null` is a missing observation. The table may omit a wholly missing row or label it “No data.” Chart types are read from Axylo'\\\"'s accessible plot description or generated summary. The fixed prompts require the standard “View as table” control.\\n\\nBoth commands return 0 for a pass, 1 for a failed grade or void run, and 2 for a setup or tool error.\\n\\n\\\"'```sh\\nnpx --no-install vitest run --root rehearsal\\nnpx --no-install vitest run --root rehearsal --exclude '\\\"'**/*.browser.test.mjs'\\n\\\"'```\\n\\nThe first command includes the Chrome tests. The second checks the fixtures, audit, agent invocation, workspace setup, and pre-browser grading without opening Chrome.\\nEOF\\nnode node_modules/vitest/vitest.mjs run --root rehearsal --exclude '\\\"'**/*.browser.test.mjs'\\\"\",\"aggregated_output\":\"\",\"exit_code\":null,\"status\":\"in_progress\"}}\nreviews/2026-11-19/wp/rehearsal-harness.events.jsonl:74:{\"type\":\"item.completed\",\"item\":{\"id\":\"item_36\",\"type\":\"command_execution\",\"command\":\"/bin/bash -lc \\\"cat > rehearsal/README.md <<'EOF'\\n# DX12 agent rehearsal\\n\\nRun from the repository root with an authenticated Codex CLI or Claude Code installation, the existing development dependencies, system Chrome, and the built documentation and packed Axylo tarball.\\n\\n\\\"'```sh\\nnode rehearsal/run.mjs --agent codex --model <model-id> --effort high --task daily-visits --wor